{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action/issues/70","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action/issues/70/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action/issues/70/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action/issues/70/events","html_url":"https://github.com/changesets/action/issues/70","id":805174190,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4MDUxNzQxOTA=","number":70,"title":"updating Version Packages PR uses GITHUB_TOKEN instead of PAT","user":{"login":"emilgp","id":869397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2OTM5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/869397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp","html_url":"https://github.com/emilgp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emilgp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2021-02-10T05:09:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T02:46:14Z","closed_at":"2026-06-25T02:46:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Background**\r\n\r\nWe have this running in master.yml\r\n```\r\n      - id: changesets\r\n        uses: changesets/action@master\r\n        with:\r\n          publish: npm run release\r\n        env:\r\n          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.PAT_TOKEN }}\r\n        ....\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe also have a separate pull_request.yml that runs the usual lint and test status checks before it can be merged\r\n\r\nWhen we used `GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}` before the PR action is not being triggered, so we had to use PAT. Now after a successful changeset merge it will create a new Version Packages PR and trigger the PR Action.\r\n\r\n**Problem**\r\n\r\nAfter a changeset merge with an existing Version Packages PR, the changes are pushed into the Version Packages PR correctly, however it is not triggering the action (git push is using GITHUB_TOKEN again)\r\n\r\nAnyone found a way to have that git push use PAT as well?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"bluwy","id":34116392,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTE2Mzky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34116392?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy","html_url":"https://github.com/bluwy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluwy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/changesets/action/issues/70/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0